28:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"The Public Provident Fund (PPF) is a government-backed long-term savings scheme with a 15-year lock-in, tax-free interest and a deduction on contributions under the old tax regime. This PPF calculator estimates your maturity value from a yearly deposit, an assumed interest rate and the number of years. It helps you plan retirement or long-term goals with a fully safe, tax-efficient option."}]
